      "label": "Gitignore Durable Companion State (Task 8)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Add .superpowers/ to .gitignore so durable companion state files (e.g. .last-token) are not committed to the repository.",
      "source_file": "C:\\Users\\Comp\\superpowers\\docs\\superpowers\\plans\\2026-06-10-visual-companion-auth-hardening.md",
