      "label": "Full Automated Verification (Task 9)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Run the focused brainstorm-server suites, the full npm test suite three times for lifecycle/watch flakes, and the repo shell lint, all expected to exit 0 before any manual verification.",
