      "id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_security_probes",
      "label": "Re-run Security Probes (Task 10)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Re-run the cross-origin attacker probe (keyed URL in headless Chrome plus an attacker page on another localhost port) and the manual browser flow only after automated probes pass, confirming 403s, no cross-origin WS, no symlink escapes, and clean reconnect.",
